From: koyu <me@koyu.space>
Date: Sun, 15 Mar 2026 13:25:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] about-distro: add Serial Numbers section, use PRETTY_NAME

Reads /etc/machine-id and derives a Device ID from the primary MAC
address (SHA256 + Base32), exposing both as hidden entries in a new
Serial Numbers section alongside the existing system serial number.
Also switches the distro name/version display to PRETTY_NAME from
os-release instead of assembling it from Name/Version/UseOSReleaseVersion,
since BlossomOS sets PRETTY_NAME directly.
---
diff --git a/kcms/about-distro/src/CMakeLists.txt b/kcms/about-distro/src/CMakeLists.txt
index a1b99ebc..87a782d7 100644
--- a/kcms/about-distro/src/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/kcms/about-distro/src/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@ target_link_libraries(kcm_about-distro  PRIVATE
     KF6::Service
     KF6::KIOGui
     KF6::AuthCore
